[
  {
    "filename": "bat1gwo3-however",
    "id": "bat1gwo3-however",
    "text": "不過"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1gwo3-however-example-1",
    "id": "bat1gwo3-however-example-1",
    "text": "我明白你嘅意思，不過我有啲唔同嘅睇法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1gwo3-however-example-2",
    "id": "bat1gwo3-however-example-2",
    "text": "呢個方法好，但係成本太高，不過我哋可以考慮下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1gwo3-however-example-3",
    "id": "bat1gwo3-however-example-3",
    "text": "佢好忙，不過仲抽時間幫我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1gwo3-however-example-4",
    "id": "bat1gwo3-however-example-4",
    "text": "我鍾意呢啲設計，不過未必啱你口味。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1jyu4-how-about",
    "id": "bat1jyu4-how-about",
    "text": "不如"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-1",
    "id": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-1",
    "text": "不如我哋出去食飯啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-2",
    "id": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-2",
    "text": "今天天氣咁好，不如去行山啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-3",
    "id": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-3",
    "text": "我哋唔如試下呢個新餐廳？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-4",
    "id": "bat1jyu4-how-about-example-4",
    "text": "唔想煮嘢食？不如叫外賣啦！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons",
    "id": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons",
    "text": "大家都有原因"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-1",
    "id": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-1",
    "text": "大家都有原因，唔好淨係責怪佢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-2",
    "id": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-2",
    "text": "跟佢講呀啦，大家都有原因，應該試下理解吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-3",
    "id": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-3",
    "text": "即使意見唔同，都要記住大家都有原因。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-4",
    "id": "daa6gaa1dou1jau5jyun4jan1-everyone-has-reasons-example-4",
    "text": "處理衝突時，要謹記大家都有原因，唔好太快評判。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down",
    "id": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down",
    "text": "大家冷靜啲"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-1",
    "id": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-1",
    "text": "大家冷靜啲，我哋慢慢傾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-2",
    "id": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-2",
    "text": "吵咁大聲，大家冷靜啲啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-3",
    "id": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-3",
    "text": "發生咩事？大家冷靜啲，唔好驚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-4",
    "id": "daa6gaa1laang5zing6di1-calm-down-example-4",
    "text": "入面好亂，大家冷靜啲先入去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe",
    "id": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe",
    "text": "但可能"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-1",
    "id": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-1",
    "text": "我覺得呢個計劃好，但可能有啲風險。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-2",
    "id": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-2",
    "text": "你講得啱，但可能我哋要考慮多啲細節。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-3",
    "id": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-3",
    "text": "呢件事應該冇問題，但可能會拖長時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-4",
    "id": "daan6ho2nang4-but-maybe-example-4",
    "text": "我明白你嘅意思，但可能我哋嘅方法唔同。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind",
    "id": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind",
    "text": "介唔介意"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-1",
    "id": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-1",
    "text": "你介唔介意我借埋你部電話用一陣？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-2",
    "id": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-2",
    "text": "介唔介意我今晚唔返屋企食飯？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-3",
    "id": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-3",
    "text": "你介唔介意我幫你睇下份文件？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-4",
    "id": "gaai3m4gaai3ji3-do-you-mind-example-4",
    "text": "介唔介意同我講多啲關於你嘅計劃？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this",
    "id": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this",
    "text": "咁樣講啦"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-1",
    "id": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-1",
    "text": "咁樣講啦，我唔係唔想去，只係今日太忙。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-2",
    "id": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-2",
    "text": "咁樣講啦，如果你唔舒服，最好休息吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-3",
    "id": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-3",
    "text": "咁樣講啦，呢件事唔係完全你嘅錯，但你都要負責任。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-4",
    "id": "gam2joeng6gong2laa1-speaking-like-this-example-4",
    "text": "咁樣講啦，你依家做嘅嘢對將來會有幫助。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right",
    "id": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right",
    "text": "講得啱"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-1",
    "id": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-1",
    "text": "你講得啱，我都係咁諗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-2",
    "id": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-2",
    "text": "噉做真係講得啱，咁先有效率。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-3",
    "id": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-3",
    "text": "佢講得啱，我哋應該接受佢嘅建議。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-4",
    "id": "gong2dak1ngaam1-youre-right-example-4",
    "text": "唔好介意，我只係覺得你講得啱啫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hai6mai6-is-it",
    "id": "hai6mai6-is-it",
    "text": "係咪"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-1",
    "id": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-1",
    "text": "你係咪今晚返屋企？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-2",
    "id": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-2",
    "text": "佢話佢今日唔嚟，係咪？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-3",
    "id": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-3",
    "text": "我哋係咪應該提前準備？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-4",
    "id": "hai6mai6-is-it-example-4",
    "text": "你真係去咗日本，係咪？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you",
    "text": "可唔可以"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-1",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-1",
    "text": "可唔可以幫我拎一下嗰個行李？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-2",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-2",
    "text": "我可唔可以早啲走？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-3",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-3",
    "text": "可唔可以借我支筆？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-4",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5-could-you-example-4",
    "text": "可唔可以同你講下我嘅想法？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time",
    "text": "可唔可以畀我啲時間"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-1",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-1",
    "text": "可唔可以畀我啲時間諗諗？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-2",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-2",
    "text": "你可唔可以畀我啲時間完成呢個任務？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-3",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-3",
    "text": "老闆，可唔可以畀我啲時間整理資料？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-4",
    "id": "ho2m4ho2ji5bei2ngo5di1si4gaan3-could-give-me-some-time-example-4",
    "text": "我可唔可以畀啲時間你考慮下？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4-maybe",
    "id": "ho2nang4-maybe",
    "text": "可能"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-1",
    "id": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-1",
    "text": "我可能今晚唔返屋企。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-2",
    "id": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-2",
    "text": "佢可能遲啲先嚟。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-3",
    "id": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-3",
    "text": "呢個消息可能係真嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-4",
    "id": "ho2nang4-maybe-example-4",
    "text": "明日可能會落雨，你準備好未？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons",
    "id": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons",
    "text": "可能有其他原因"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-1",
    "id": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-1",
    "text": "我哋唔應該急住判斷，可能有其他原因。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-2",
    "id": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-2",
    "text": "呢個問題唔係咁簡單，可能有其他原因導致。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-3",
    "id": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-3",
    "text": "你講嘅都啱，但可能有其他原因令情況變得複雜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-4",
    "id": "ho2nang4jau5kei4taa1jyu4yin4-maybe-other-reasons-example-4",
    "text": "你可以試下諗多啲，可能有其他原因未考慮到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2can-be-said",
    "id": "ho2zi2can-be-said",
    "text": "可以話"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-1",
    "id": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-1",
    "text": "呢個問題，可以話係一個好大嘅挑戰。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-2",
    "id": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-2",
    "text": "佢嘅成功，可以話係靠堅持同努力。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-3",
    "id": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-3",
    "text": "依家嘅市場，可以話變化好快。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-4",
    "id": "ho2zi2can-be-said-example-4",
    "text": "佢講嘅嘢，可以話幾有道理。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think",
    "id": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think",
    "text": "可以咁諗"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-1",
    "id": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-1",
    "text": "你可以咁諗，呢件事係一個學習嘅機會。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-2",
    "id": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-2",
    "text": "遇到困難，你可以咁諗，係一種成長。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-3",
    "id": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-3",
    "text": "我哋可以咁諗，如果唔試吓，就唔知道結果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-4",
    "id": "ho2zi2soeng6you-could-think-example-4",
    "text": "其實，你可以咁諗，佢只係想幫手。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hung2paa3-im-afraid",
    "id": "hung2paa3-im-afraid",
    "text": "恐怕"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-1",
    "id": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-1",
    "text": "恐怕我唔能夠今晚去派對。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-2",
    "id": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-2",
    "text": "恐怕佢未準備好做報告。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-3",
    "id": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-3",
    "text": "恐怕今晚落雨，唔適合郊遊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-4",
    "id": "hung2paa3-im-afraid-example-4",
    "text": "恐怕我冇時間陪你去睇戲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5di1-somewhat",
    "id": "jau5di1-somewhat",
    "text": "有啲"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-1",
    "id": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-1",
    "text": "我今日有啲攰，想早啲休息。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-2",
    "id": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-2",
    "text": "呢個菜有啲辣，你要小心食。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-3",
    "id": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-3",
    "text": "佢講嘢有啲含糊，唔係好清楚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-4",
    "id": "jau5di1-somewhat-example-4",
    "text": "今次考試有啲難，不過我盡力咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider",
    "id": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider",
    "text": "要唔要諗下"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-1",
    "id": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-1",
    "text": "要唔要諗下換份工，可能會開心啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-2",
    "id": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-2",
    "text": "依家做唔到，唔好心急，要唔要諗下遲啲再試？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-3",
    "id": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-3",
    "text": "你要唔要諗下報讀夜校，提升自己技術？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-4",
    "id": "jiu3m4jiu3soeng2haa5-why-not-consider-example-4",
    "text": "成日唔開心，要唔要諗下去旅行放鬆下？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me",
    "text": "如果係我"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-1",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-1",
    "text": "如果係我，我就唔會咁做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-2",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-2",
    "text": "你想咁做，不過如果係我，我會考慮清楚啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-3",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-3",
    "text": "如果係我，我會同佢講清楚啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-4",
    "id": "jyu4gwo2hai6ngo5-If-it-were-me-example-4",
    "text": "你咁做好唔好？如果係我，我會先諗諗後果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you",
    "id": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you",
    "text": "其實唔係針對你"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-1",
    "id": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-1",
    "text": "其實唔係針對你，我淨係覺得呢個做法未必啱。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-2",
    "id": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-2",
    "text": "你唔好誤會， 其實唔係針對你，只係大家意見唔同。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-3",
    "id": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-3",
    "text": "喺會議上講嘅嘢， 其實唔係針對你，只係想表達我哋嘅立場。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-4",
    "id": "kei4sat6m4hai6zam1deoi3nei5-not-directed-at-you-example-4",
    "text": "其實唔係針對你，我哋只係希望改進工作流程。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault",
    "id": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault",
    "text": "唔係你嘅錯"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-1",
    "id": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-1",
    "text": "唔係你嘅錯，呢件事係因為系統出咗問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-2",
    "id": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-2",
    "text": "唔係你嘅錯，老細講錯咗指示。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-3",
    "id": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-3",
    "text": "我知道你難過，但唔係你嘅錯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-4",
    "id": "m4hai6nei5dik1co3-not-your-fault-example-4",
    "text": "唔係你嘅錯，我哋一齊面對呢個問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant",
    "id": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant",
    "text": "唔係話唔得"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-1",
    "id": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-1",
    "text": "唔係話唔得，但係時間真係唔夠。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-2",
    "id": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-2",
    "text": "我唔係話唔得你提議，只係覺得仲有其他選擇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-3",
    "id": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-3",
    "text": "唔係話唔得改動計劃，但係成本會高好多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-4",
    "id": "m4hai6waa6m4dak1-not-that-it-cant-example-4",
    "text": "唔係話唔得試吓，但我建議要小心啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me",
    "id": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me",
    "text": "唔好意思"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-1",
    "id": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-1",
    "text": "唔好意思，我唔係好明白你講咩。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-2",
    "id": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-2",
    "text": "唔好意思，可唔可以借過一陣？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-3",
    "id": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-3",
    "text": "唔好意思，我遲咗少少先嚟到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-4",
    "id": "m4hou2ji3si1-sorry-excuse-me-example-4",
    "text": "唔好意思，我想問你一個問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong",
    "id": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong",
    "text": "唔好誤會"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-1",
    "id": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-1",
    "text": "唔好誤會，我唔係針對你，淨係想提出啲建議。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-2",
    "id": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-2",
    "text": "我講呢個唔係批評你，唔好誤會啊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-3",
    "id": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-3",
    "text": "唔好誤會，我嘅意思係我哋需要更多時間嚟完成。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-4",
    "id": "m4hou2ng6wui6-dont-get-me-wrong-example-4",
    "text": "你唔好誤會，我冇任何惡意，只係想幫忙啫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush",
    "id": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush",
    "text": "唔使急"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-1",
    "id": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-1",
    "text": "你慢慢嚟，唔使急。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-2",
    "id": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-2",
    "text": "考試仲有半個鐘，唔使急咁做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-3",
    "id": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-3",
    "text": "我哋未決定，唔使急答我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-4",
    "id": "m4sai2gap1-no-need-to-rush-example-4",
    "text": "今次旅行唔使急，可以慢慢享受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this",
    "id": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this",
    "text": "唔想搞到咁"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-1",
    "id": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-1",
    "text": "我真係唔想搞到咁，大家一齊冷靜吓好唔好？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-2",
    "id": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-2",
    "text": "唔想搞到咁錯嘅，但係有時候事情都發展得好快。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-3",
    "id": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-3",
    "text": "如果唔講清楚，真係唔想搞到咁尷尬啫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-4",
    "id": "m4soeng2gaau2dou3gam3-didnt-want-this-example-4",
    "text": "我哋原本只係傾下計，唔想搞到咁嚴重。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if",
    "id": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if",
    "text": "唔知係唔係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-1",
    "id": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-1",
    "text": "唔知係唔係今日會落雨？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-2",
    "id": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-2",
    "text": "我唔知係唔係佢講嗰句話。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-3",
    "id": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-3",
    "text": "唔知係唔係要遲啲先開始？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-4",
    "id": "m4zi1hai6m4hai6-not-sure-if-example-4",
    "text": "佢好似唔知係唔係應該去嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through",
    "id": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through",
    "text": "慢慢講"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-1",
    "id": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-1",
    "text": "你而家唔好激動，慢慢講我哋點解會有誤會。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-2",
    "id": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-2",
    "text": "有問題我哋慢慢講，唔好一齊爆燈。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-3",
    "id": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-3",
    "text": "你有咩疑問我可以慢慢講清楚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-4",
    "id": "maan6maan6gong2-talk-it-through-example-4",
    "text": "我哋先坐低，慢慢講吓點樣解決問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly",
    "id": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly",
    "text": "慢慢傾"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-1",
    "id": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-1",
    "text": "呢件事我哋慢慢傾，唔好急住決定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-2",
    "id": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-2",
    "text": "發生咩事？慢慢傾，唔使驚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-3",
    "id": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-3",
    "text": "我哋唔好爭嘈，慢慢傾先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-4",
    "id": "maan6maan6king1-discuss-calmly-example-4",
    "text": "處理問題時，最好係慢慢傾嘅方式。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily",
    "id": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily",
    "text": "未必"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-1",
    "id": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-1",
    "text": "佢未必會嚟，今天天氣唔穩定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-2",
    "id": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-2",
    "text": "做得咁快未必好，細心啲會好過。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-3",
    "id": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-3",
    "text": "呢件事未必只係佢一個人的錯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-4",
    "id": "mei6bit1-not-necessarily-example-4",
    "text": "天氣預報講會落雨，但未必一定落。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient",
    "id": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient",
    "text": "未必方便"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-1",
    "id": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-1",
    "text": "我下星期去你屋企，未必方便，你話吓得唔得？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-2",
    "id": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-2",
    "text": "你想約我今晚食飯？未必方便呀，我有啲嘢做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-3",
    "id": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-3",
    "text": "我哋可以改日傾，因為今日未必方便見面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-4",
    "id": "mei6bit1fong1bin6-not-convenient-example-4",
    "text": "等咗你咁耐打電話，我估你未必方便答我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that",
    "id": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that",
    "text": "未必係咁"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-1",
    "id": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-1",
    "text": "你話佢唔嚟，未必係咁，佢可能仲未決定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-2",
    "id": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-2",
    "text": "市場冇咁多人，未必係咁，試吓喺其他時間去睇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-3",
    "id": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-3",
    "text": "佢唔鐘意呢啲嘢，未必係咁，每個人嘅口味唔同。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-4",
    "id": "mei6bit1hai6gam3-might-not-be-like-that-example-4",
    "text": "事情冇咁簡單，未必係咁，要了解多啲先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet",
    "id": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet",
    "text": "未必而家講得清楚"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-1",
    "id": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-1",
    "text": "未必而家講得清楚，你等陣我再解釋吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-2",
    "id": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃嘅細節未必而家講得清楚，要睇多啲資料。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-3",
    "id": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-3",
    "text": "你啱啱收到嘅消息未必而家講得清楚，等多陣先可信啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-4",
    "id": "mei6bit1ji4gaa1gong2dak1cing1co2-might-not-be-clear-yet-example-4",
    "text": "關於呢個問題，未必而家講得清楚，等我哋討論完先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that",
    "id": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that",
    "text": "未必完全係咁"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-1",
    "id": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-1",
    "text": "我覺得佢講嘅未必完全係咁，你要聽多啲其他人嘅意見。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-2",
    "id": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-2",
    "text": "呢個問題未必完全係咁簡單，背後可能有更多原因。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-3",
    "id": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-3",
    "text": "你話佢唔可靠，但其實情況未必完全係咁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-4",
    "id": "mei6bit1jyun4cyun4hai6gam3-not-entirely-like-that-example-4",
    "text": "我哋未必完全係咁認為呢件事無解，仲有其他方法可以試吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through",
    "id": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through",
    "text": "未諗清楚"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-1",
    "id": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-1",
    "text": "我唔想即刻答你，我未諗清楚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-2",
    "id": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃好似匆忙決定，我覺得大家未諗清楚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-3",
    "id": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-3",
    "text": "唔好批評佢啦，佢未諗清楚先講。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-4",
    "id": "mei6nam2cing1co2-not-thought-through-example-4",
    "text": "我哋做嘢之前要諗清楚，唔好未諗清楚就亂做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2haa5-think-about-it",
    "id": "nam2haa5-think-about-it",
    "text": "諗下"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-1",
    "id": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-1",
    "text": "呢個方案唔錯，你諗下先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-2",
    "id": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-2",
    "text": "你唔好即刻答我，諗下先啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-3",
    "id": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-3",
    "text": "呢件事有啲複雜，你最好諗下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-4",
    "id": "nam2haa5-think-about-it-example-4",
    "text": "我哋唔好急住決定，諗下所有可能嘅選擇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think",
    "id": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think",
    "text": "你覺得點"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-1",
    "id": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-1",
    "text": "我哋今晚去邊度食飯， 你覺得點？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-2",
    "id": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-2",
    "text": "呢份報告寫得唔錯，你覺得點？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-3",
    "id": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-3",
    "text": "依家咁嘅安排合理嗎？你覺得點？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-4",
    "id": "nei5gok3dak1dim2-what-do-you-think-example-4",
    "text": "我打算買部新手機，你覺得點？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same",
    "id": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same",
    "text": "我都覺得"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-1",
    "text": "你講得啱，我都覺得咁樣做最好。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-2",
    "text": "佢話嗰部電影好睇，我都覺得非常精彩。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-3",
    "text": "關於呢個計劃，我都覺得需要再傾下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5dou1gok3dak1-i-feel-the-same-example-4",
    "text": "如果你覺得唔方便，我都覺得可以改日再約。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree",
    "id": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree",
    "text": "我都認同"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-1",
    "text": "我都認同你講嘅意見。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-2",
    "text": "佢認為呢個方案好，我都認同。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-3",
    "text": "關於呢件事，我都認同你嘅睇法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5dou1jing6tung4-i-also-agree-example-4",
    "text": "大家都提出咗唔同嘅意見，我都認同呢個建議。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest",
    "id": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest",
    "text": "我建議"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-1",
    "text": "我建議你試下呢間餐廳，啲嘢好好食。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-2",
    "text": "喺咁嘅情況下，我建議我哋諗多啲時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-3",
    "text": "我建議你唔好遲到，因為會影響大家。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5gin3ji3-i-suggest-example-4",
    "text": "如果你唔識做，我建議你問下同事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel",
    "id": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel",
    "text": "我覺得"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-1",
    "text": "我覺得今天天氣幾好，我哋去散步啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-2",
    "text": "我覺得呢個計劃要再諗清楚先得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-3",
    "text": "對於你嘅建議，我覺得有啲道理。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5gok3dak1-i-feel-example-4",
    "text": "講真，我覺得你今日比平時努力好多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view",
    "id": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view",
    "text": "我有啲唔同睇法"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-1",
    "text": "我有啲唔同睇法，所以我建議再考慮一次。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-2",
    "text": "你講得啱，但我有啲唔同睇法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-3",
    "text": "呢件事我有啲唔同睇法，想同你分享下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5jau5di1m4tung4tai2faat3-different-view-example-4",
    "text": "討論中，我有啲唔同睇法，希望可以討論得更深入。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble",
    "text": "我唔係想搞事"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-1",
    "text": "我唔係想搞事，我只係想講清楚啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-2",
    "text": "放心啦，我真係我唔係想搞事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-3",
    "text": "我話嘅嘢唔係針對任何人，我唔係想搞事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2gaau2si6-not-trying-to-cause-trouble-example-4",
    "text": "如果我講嘢錯咗，你知我唔係想搞事呀。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated",
    "text": "我唔係想令事情複雜"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-1",
    "text": "我唔係想令事情複雜，但我覺得我哋應該澄清一下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-2",
    "text": "你聽住，我真係我唔係想令事情複雜，淨係想大家明白啫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-3",
    "text": "喺呢個會議上，我唔係想令事情複雜，只係想提出啲問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5m4hai6soeng2ling6si6cing4fuk1zaap6-try-not-to-make-things-complicated-example-4",
    "text": "你唔使擔心，我講呢句，只係因為我唔係想令事情複雜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree",
    "id": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree",
    "text": "我唔太同意"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-1",
    "text": "我唔太同意你嘅睇法，我覺得情況可能係另一回事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-2",
    "text": "呢個提議我唔太同意，我覺得仲有改進嘅空間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-3",
    "text": "我唔太同意你噉講，但我可以明白你嘅立場。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5m4tai2tung4i-dont-fully-agree-example-4",
    "text": "對於呢件事，我哋有啲唔同意，我唔太同意個方法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you",
    "id": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you",
    "text": "我明白你意思"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-1",
    "text": "我明白你意思，但我有啲唔同意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-2",
    "text": "多謝你解釋，我明白你意思。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-3",
    "text": "我明白你意思，不過我覺得應該試多一次。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5ming4baak6nei5ji3si1-i-understand-you-example-4",
    "text": "雖然我明白你意思，但我有其他嘅睇法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-think",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-think",
    "text": "我諗"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-1",
    "text": "我諗呢個方案好啱我哋嘅需要。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-2",
    "text": "我諗你應該試下呢個新餐廳。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-3",
    "text": "我諗佢可能唔知道呢件事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5nam2-i-think-example-4",
    "text": "我諗我哋下星期開會再傾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think",
    "id": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think",
    "text": "我需要時間諗下"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-1",
    "text": "我需要時間諗下呢個提議先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-2",
    "text": "你講嘅嘢好重要，我需要時間諗下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-3",
    "text": "喺決定之前，我都想先需要時間諗下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5seoi1jiu3si4gaan3soeng2haa5-i-need-time-to-think-example-4",
    "text": "唔好急住答我，我需要時間諗下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts",
    "id": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts",
    "text": "我懷疑"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-1",
    "text": "我懷疑呢個計劃可唔可以成功。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-2",
    "text": "你講嘅數字，我懷疑啱唔啱。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-3",
    "text": "我懷疑佢真係記得嗰件事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5wai4ji4-have-doubts-example-4",
    "text": "我懷疑呢個方案仲有不足嘅地方。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel",
    "id": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel",
    "text": "我只係覺得"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-1",
    "text": "我只係覺得佢做嘢咪太急咗啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-2",
    "text": "我只係覺得呢個計劃未必係最好嘅選擇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-3",
    "text": "我只係覺得我哋可以試下另一個方法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5zi2hai6gok3dak1-i-just-feel-example-4",
    "text": "我只係覺得佢講嘅唔係咁啱。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening",
    "id": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening",
    "text": "少少"
  },
  {
    "filename": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-1",
    "id": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-1",
    "text": "可以幫我講少少快啲嗎？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-2",
    "id": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-2",
    "text": "今日嘅湯味道要調少少鹹。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-3",
    "id": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-3",
    "text": "我哋試下遲啲出發，等時間多少少。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-4",
    "id": "siu2siu2-a-little-softening-example-4",
    "text": "呢件衫細咗，你可唔可以改大少少？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3gong2-as-mentioned-last-time",
    "id": "soeng6ci3gong2-as-mentioned-last-time",
    "text": "上次講"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-1",
    "text": "上次講，你會點做？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-2",
    "text": "上次講，我哋要早啲開始。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-3",
    "text": "上次講，你哋住邊度？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6ci3gong2-example-4",
    "text": "上次講，我最鍾意呢個方法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment",
    "id": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment",
    "text": "諗一諗"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-1",
    "id": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-1",
    "text": "你唔好急，諗一諗先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-2",
    "id": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-2",
    "text": "呢個主意唔錯，唔該諗一諗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-3",
    "id": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-3",
    "text": "喺答唔之前，諗一諗你想要乜嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-4",
    "id": "soeng2soeng2jat1haa5-think-for-a-moment-example-4",
    "text": "我建議你諗一諗先，再決定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could",
    "id": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could",
    "text": "或者可以"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-1",
    "id": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-1",
    "text": "或者可以我哋今晚去食意大利菜？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-2",
    "id": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-2",
    "text": "或者可以試下換另一部手機？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-3",
    "id": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-3",
    "text": "我哋或者可以明天再討論一次。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-4",
    "id": "waak6ze2ho2ji5-maybe-we-could-example-4",
    "text": "如果唔趕時間，或者可以行路去公園。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways",
    "id": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways",
    "text": "或者有其他方法"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-1",
    "id": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-1",
    "text": "我哋依家未必要咁做，或者有其他方法可以試下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-2",
    "id": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃唔一定係最好，或者有其他方法更適合我哋。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-3",
    "id": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-3",
    "text": "我唔肯定呢個方案嘅效果，或者有其他方法能達到目標。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-4",
    "id": "waak6ze2jau5kei4taa1fong1faat3-other-ways-example-4",
    "text": "討論完之後，我諗或者有其他方法我哋未考慮過。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better",
    "id": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better",
    "text": "會唔會好啲"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-1",
    "id": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-1",
    "text": "我哋會唔會好啲坐巴士去嗰度？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-2",
    "id": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-2",
    "text": "你會唔會好啲提早準備功課？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-3",
    "id": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-3",
    "text": "會唔會好啲唔好咁趕，慢慢嚟？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-4",
    "id": "wui5m4wui5hou2di1-would-it-be-better-example-4",
    "text": "你覺得會唔會好啲換間公司做？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be",
    "id": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be",
    "text": "最好係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-1",
    "id": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-1",
    "text": "最好係你而家準備好，咁等會先唔怕緊張。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-2",
    "id": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-2",
    "text": "你最好係趁早搵律師幫手，免得後悔。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-3",
    "id": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-3",
    "text": "我覺得最好係我哋一齊去商量下，唔好自己諗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-4",
    "id": "zeoi3hou2hai6-best-would-be-example-4",
    "text": "你最好係今晚早啲訓覺，明日先有精神。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is",
    "id": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is",
    "text": "之所以"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-1",
    "id": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-1",
    "text": "我唔去旅行，之所以係因為我冇時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-2",
    "id": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-2",
    "text": "公司之所以咁快發展，係因為員工合作得好。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-3",
    "id": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-3",
    "text": "佢之所以成功，係因為佢付出咗好多努力。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-4",
    "id": "zi1so2ji5-the-reason-is-example-4",
    "text": "我哋唔需要擔心，之所以咁講係有充分嘅資料支持。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that",
    "id": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that",
    "text": "只不過係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-1",
    "id": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-1",
    "text": "我只不過係想幫手，你唔使咁緊張。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-2",
    "id": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-2",
    "text": "佢只不過係遲咗啲，無乜大問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-3",
    "id": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-3",
    "text": "我只不過係唔想影響其他人嘅決定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-4",
    "id": "zi2bat1gwo3hai6-its-just-that-example-4",
    "text": "你只不過係誤會咗啫，唔駛咁介意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say",
    "id": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say",
    "text": "只係想講"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-1",
    "id": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-1",
    "text": "只係想講，你遲咗返嚟，要通知下我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-2",
    "id": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-2",
    "text": "只係想講，呢件事我覺得唔太妥當。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-3",
    "id": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-3",
    "text": "只係想講，多啲人尊重下對方嘅感受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-4",
    "id": "zi2hai6soeng2gong2-just-wanted-to-say-example-4",
    "text": "只係想講，如果需要幫手，記住講聲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zing3hai6-simply",
    "id": "zing3hai6-simply",
    "text": "淨係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zing3hai6-simply-example-1",
    "id": "zing3hai6-simply-example-1",
    "text": "我淨係想睇戲，唔想出街。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zing3hai6-simply-example-2",
    "id": "zing3hai6-simply-example-2",
    "text": "佢淨係鍾意食辣嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zing3hai6-simply-example-3",
    "id": "zing3hai6-simply-example-3",
    "text": "今次考試淨係答咗五題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zing3hai6-simply-example-4",
    "id": "zing3hai6-simply-example-4",
    "text": "你淨係要記住呢個規則。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point",
    "id": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point",
    "text": "仲有一個點"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-1",
    "id": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-1",
    "text": "我哋去旅行好唔錯，仲有一個點係可以學到新嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-2",
    "id": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-2",
    "text": "你話要早啲收工，仲有一個點係唔好拖延。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-3",
    "id": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-3",
    "text": "我覺得呢個計劃有優點，仲有一個點係可以幫助團隊合作。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-4",
    "id": "zung6jau5jat1go3dim2-also-one-point-example-4",
    "text": "你解釋得好清楚，仲有一個點想補充一下。"
  }
]